uplink-binarykey-name = Binary Translation Key
uplink-binarykey-desc = A encryption key that actively translates binary used by cyborgs real-time. Potentially useful for gathering extra information.

uplink-crime-cleaner-name = Crime cleaner kit
uplink-crime-cleaner-desc = This kit contains everything needed to cover up a crime. Contains a residueless soap, a cleanade, space cleaner and nitrile gloves. Prevent lawsuits!

uplink-lantern-name = Ultrabright Lantern
uplink-lantern-desc = A motion-triggered lantern that will blind anyone in range. Remember your sunglasses - or just close your eyes.

uplink-lobbying-bundle-name = NT lobbying bundle
uplink-lobbying-bundle-desc = A briefcase containing everything needed to make an offer they can't refuse. Contains 20K Spesos in cash, and some cool dealer clothing.

uplink-NT-keys-name = Two NanoTrasen Encryption Keys
uplink-NT-keys-desc = Contains two encryption keys on a classified frequency for the price of just one. Quite the deal!
